      "volume_fraction": 0.4398,
      "planform_fraction": 0.5968,
      "design": "hpr has no tabulated nose: the power-series nose g = xi^n with n = 0.6369 has the table's volume (a monotone cubic through the points gives 0.4398 of pi R^2 L), which sets its slender-body CP, and its planform area within 2.4% (0.611 against 0.597 of 2RL)",
